Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:04:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Ely.by skin management for offline accounts

Offline accounts keep their skin on Ely.by under the same username.
Reads use public endpoints; changes run through the Ely.by website in an
embedded window where the player signs in once (Ely.by has no skin API).
Adds a Manage skin on Ely.by modal to the Skins page for offline accounts.
